            <span class="lane__tag" data-i18n="ben.tagReexplain">↺ reexplicar</span>
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-10 sm:mb-12">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-egc-600 dark:text-egc-400 mb-3">The Solution</p>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">One install. Every tool. Permanent memory.</h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">egc install detects which AI tools you have and sets each one up with what it can read: skills, rules and hooks everywhere, and the two MCP servers in the ten tools it registers them in today. The AI reads your project state at the start of every session and saves decisions at the end.</p>
