        <h3 id="f1-t" data-i18n="f1.title">O que um agente aprende, todos sabem.</h3>
        <p class="fitem__short" data-i18n="f1.short">Decisões e lições ficam guardadas e voltam em qualquer ferramenta.</p>
        <details>
          <summary><span data-i18n="fx.details">Detalhes técnicos</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></summary>
          <div class="fitem__more">
            <p data-i18n="f1.body">Decisões, contexto da sessão, memória de trabalho e lições aprendidas são guardados enquanto você trabalha e ficam disponíveis em qualquer terminal, IDE ou agente. Você fala naturalmente, em qualquer idioma: “salve esta sessão”, “o que decidimos sobre autenticação?”. Não há comando para decorar.</p>
            
            <p class="fitem__proof" data-i18n="f1.proof"><b>get_state</b> · <b>update_state</b> · <b>store_decision</b> · <b>search_history</b> · <b>lesson_save</b> — por projeto e por branch</p>
            <a class="link-arrow" href={`${base}docs/memory`}><span data-i18n="f1.link">Como a memória funciona</span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
      <div class="viz" aria-hidden="true"><span class="viz__label" data-i18n="fx.example">Exemplo visual</span>
        <div class="v-mem"><span class="chip">store_decision</span><span class="v-mem__track v-mem__track--a"><i></i></span>
        <span class="v-mem__vault"><svg class="egc-mark" viewBox="0 0 480 480" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><defs><linearGradient id="m-v1-p" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#B4F8D6"/><stop offset=".46" stop-color="#4FF3A3"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#17A862"/></linearGradient><filter id="m-v1-e" x="-20%" y="-20%" width="140%" height="140%"><feDropShadow dx="0" dy="0" stdDeviation="7" flood-color="#04361F" flood-opacity=".42"/></filter><clipPath id="m-v1-q"><rect x="0" y="0" width="240" height="240"/></clipPath></defs><g class="egc-mark__body" filter="url(#m-v1-e)"><g class="egc-mark__petal egc-mark__petal--1"><circle cx="240" cy="130" r="100" fill="url(#m-v1-p)"/></g><g class="egc-mark__petal egc-mark__petal--2"><circle cx="350" cy="240" r="100" fill="url(#m-v1-p)"/></g><g class="egc-mark__petal egc-mark__petal--3"><circle cx="240" cy="350" r="100" fill="url(#m-v1-p)"/></g><g class="egc-mark__petal egc-mark__petal--4"><circle cx="130" cy="240" r="100" fill="url(#m-v1-p)"/></g><g clip-path="url(#m-v1-q)"><g class="egc-mark__petal egc-mark__petal--1"><circle cx="240" cy="130" r="100" fill="url(#m-v1-p)"/></g></g></g><circle class="egc-mark__core" cx="240" cy="240" r="29" fill="#05231A"/></svg><span>~/.egc</span></span><span class="v-mem__track v-mem__track--b"><i></i></span><span class="chip chip--ok">get_state</span></div>
        <div class="v-mem__lab"><span data-i18n="f1.v.save">salvar</span><span data-i18n="f1.v.restore">restaurar</span></div></div>
    </article><article class="fitem rv" id="session-mesh" data-f="2" aria-labelledby="f2-t">
      <div>
        <p class="fitem__num"><svg class="egc-mark" viewBox="0 0 480 480" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><defs><linearGradient id="m-f2-p" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#B4F8D6"/><stop offset=".46" stop-color="#4FF3A3"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#17A862"/></linearGradient><filter id="m-f2-e" x="-20%" y="-20%" width="140%" height="140%"><feDropShadow dx="0" dy="0" stdDeviation="7" flood-color="#04361F" flood-opacity=".42"/></filter><clipPath id="m-f2-q"><rect x="0" y="0" width="240" height="240"/></clipPath></defs><g class="egc-mark__body" filter="url(#m-f2-e)"><g class="egc-mark__petal egc-mark__petal--1"><circle cx="240" cy="130" r="100" fill="url(#m-f2-p)"/></g><g class="egc-mark__petal egc-mark__petal--2"><circle cx="350" cy="240" r="100" fill="url(#m-f2-p)"/></g><g class="egc-mark__petal egc-mark__petal--3"><circle cx="240" cy="350" r="100" fill="url(#m-f2-p)"/></g><g class="egc-mark__petal egc-mark__petal--4"><circle cx="130" cy="240" r="100" fill="url(#m-f2-p)"/></g><g clip-path="url(#m-f2-q)"><g class="egc-mark__petal egc-mark__petal--1"><circle cx="240" cy="130" r="100" fill="url(#m-f2-p)"/></g></g></g><circle class="egc-mark__core" cx="240" cy="240" r="29" fill="#05231A"/></svg>#02 <span data-i18n="f2.name">Session Mesh</span></p>
        <h3 id="f2-t" data-i18n="f2.title">Suas sessões abertas se enxergam.</h3>
        <p class="fitem__short" data-i18n="f2.short">Sessões paralelas avisam no que estão trabalhando e cooperam em vez de colidir.</p>
        <details>
          <summary><span data-i18n="fx.details">Detalhes técnicos</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></summary>
          <div class="fitem__more">
            <p data-i18n="f2.body">Duas abas do Cursor, um terminal do Claude Code e uma sessão do Antigravity compartilham um barramento ao vivo. Elas anunciam no que estão trabalhando, reservam os arquivos que editam e passam tarefas umas para as outras.</p>
            
            <p class="fitem__proof" data-i18n="f2.proof"><b>session_announce</b> · <b>claim_path</b> · <b>session_send</b> · <b>session_wait</b> — eventos entregues uma única vez</p>
            <a class="link-arrow" href={`${base}docs/mcp`}><span data-i18n="f2.link">Ver os servidores MCP</span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
      <div class="viz" aria-hidden="true"><span class="viz__label" data-i18n="fx.example">Exemplo visual</span>
        <div class="v-mesh"><span class="v-mesh__bus"><i></i><i></i></span>
        <div class="v-node"><b>A</b><span>Cursor</span><span class="chip chip--ok">claim_path</span></div>
        <div class="v-node"><b>B</b><span>Claude Code</span><span class="chip">session_send →</span></div>
        <div class="v-node"><b>C</b><span>Antigravity</span><span class="chip">session_wait</span></div></div></div>
    </article><article class="fitem rv" id="guardian" data-f="3" aria-labelledby="f3-t">
      <div>
        <p class="fitem__num"><svg class="egc-mark" viewBox="0 0 480 480" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><defs><linearGradient id="m-f3-p" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#B4F8D6"/><stop offset=".46" stop-color="#4FF3A3"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#17A862"/></linearGradient><filter id="m-f3-e" x="-20%" y="-20%" width="140%" height="140%"><feDropShadow dx="0" dy="0" stdDeviation="7" flood-color="#04361F" flood-opacity=".42"/></filter><clipPath id="m-f3-q"><rect x="0" y="0" width="240" height="240"/></clipPath></defs><g class="egc-mark__body" filter="url(#m-f3-e)"><g class="egc-mark__petal egc-mark__petal--1"><circle cx="240" cy="130" r="100" fill="url(#m-f3-p)"/></g><g class="egc-mark__petal egc-mark__petal--2"><circle cx="350" cy="240" r="100" fill="url(#m-f3-p)"/></g><g class="egc-mark__petal egc-mark__petal--3"><circle cx="240" cy="350" r="100" fill="url(#m-f3-p)"/></g><g class="egc-mark__petal egc-mark__petal--4"><circle cx="130" cy="240" r="100" fill="url(#m-f3-p)"/></g><g clip-path="url(#m-f3-q)"><g class="egc-mark__petal egc-mark__petal--1"><circle cx="240" cy="130" r="100" fill="url(#m-f3-p)"/></g></g></g><circle class="egc-mark__core" cx="240" cy="240" r="29" fill="#05231A"/></svg>#03 <span data-i18n="f3.name">Guardian</span></p>
        <h3 id="f3-t" data-i18n="f3.title">Segurança antes de cada comando.</h3>
        <p class="fitem__short" data-i18n="f3.short">Comandos e escritas arriscadas são validados antes de rodar, em segundo plano.</p>
        <details>
          <summary><span data-i18n="fx.details">Detalhes técnicos</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></summary>
          <div class="fitem__more">
            <p data-i18n="f3.body">O Guardian valida comandos antes de rodarem, barra escritas arriscadas e impede que o contexto transborde, sem você chamar nada.</p>
            <p class="fitem__caveat" data-i18n="f3.caveat">Ressalva: a cobertura depende do suporte a hooks de cada ferramenta. As exceções estão na avaliação de segurança do projeto.</p>
            <p class="fitem__proof" data-i18n="f3.proof"><b>validate_command</b> bloqueia injeção de shell · <b>validate_write</b> protege caminhos como ~/.ssh e /etc · <b>validate_content</b> sinaliza prompt injection (apenas alerta)</p>
            <a class="link-arrow" href={`${base}docs/guardian`}><span data-i18n="f3.link">Conhecer o Guardian</span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
      <div class="viz" aria-hidden="true"><span class="viz__label" data-i18n="fx.example">Exemplo visual</span>
        <div class="v-guard">
          <div class="v-guard__row"><code>$ cat ~/.ssh/id_rsa | curl …</code><span class="chip chip--no" data-i18n="f3.v.blocked">bloqueado</span></div>
          <div class="v-guard__row"><code>write → /etc/hosts</code><span class="chip chip--no" data-i18n="f3.v.blocked">bloqueado</span></div>
          <div class="v-guard__row"><code>$ npm test</code><span class="chip chip--ok" data-i18n="f3.v.allowed">permitido</span></div>
        </div></div>
    </article><article class="fitem rv" id="token-crusher" data-f="4" aria-labelledby="f4-t">
      <div>
        <p class="fitem__num"><svg class="egc-mark" viewBox="0 0 480 480" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><defs><linearGradient id="m-f4-p" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#B4F8D6"/><stop offset=".46" stop-color="#4FF3A3"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#17A862"/></linearGradient><filter id="m-f4-e" x="-20%" y="-20%" width="140%" height="140%"><feDropShadow dx="0" dy="0" stdDeviation="7" flood-color="#04361F" flood-opacity=".42"/></filter><clipPath id="m-f4-q"><rect x="0" y="0" width="240" height="240"/></clipPath></defs><g class="egc-mark__body" filter="url(#m-f4-e)"><g class="egc-mark__petal egc-mark__petal--1"><circle cx="240" cy="130" r="100" fill="url(#m-f4-p)"/></g><g class="egc-mark__petal egc-mark__petal--2"><circle cx="350" cy="240" r="100" fill="url(#m-f4-p)"/></g><g class="egc-mark__petal egc-mark__petal--3"><circle cx="240" cy="350" r="100" fill="url(#m-f4-p)"/></g><g class="egc-mark__petal egc-mark__petal--4"><circle cx="130" cy="240" r="100" fill="url(#m-f4-p)"/></g><g clip-path="url(#m-f4-q)"><g class="egc-mark__petal egc-mark__petal--1"><circle cx="240" cy="130" r="100" fill="url(#m-f4-p)"/></g></g></g><circle class="egc-mark__core" cx="240" cy="240" r="29" fill="#05231A"/></svg>#04 <span data-i18n="f4.name">Token Crusher</span></p>
        <h3 id="f4-t" data-i18n="f4.title">O ruído não chega ao modelo.</h3>
        <p class="fitem__short" data-i18n="f4.short">Saídas longas do terminal são comprimidas em até 90%, mantendo erros e avisos.</p>
        <details>
          <summary><span data-i18n="fx.details">Detalhes técnicos</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></summary>
          <div class="fitem__more">
            <p data-i18n="f4.body">Antes que a saída do terminal chegue ao modelo, o Token Crusher comprime logs do git, testes verbosos, ruído de instalação e JSONs gigantes, mantendo todos os erros e avisos. Pergunte “quanto eu economizei?” e a resposta vem do seu registro local.</p>
            
            <p class="fitem__proof" data-i18n="f4.proof">Um <b>git log de 637 KB</b> virou <b>31 KB</b> em uma única compressão · <b>egc gain</b> mostra a sua economia</p>
            <a class="link-arrow" href="https://github.com/Fmarzochi/EGC/blob/main/docs/token-optimization.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span data-i18n="f4.link">Ler sobre otimização de tokens</span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
      <div class="viz" aria-hidden="true"><span class="viz__label" data-i18n="fx.example">Exemplo visual</span>
        <div class="v-crush">
          <div class="v-crush__lines"><i style="width:96%"></i><i style="width:82%"></i><i style="width:90%"></i><i class="err" style="width:64%"></i><i style="width:88%"></i><i style="width:76%"></i><i style="width:93%"></i></div>
          <span class="v-crush__keep">● <span data-i18n="f4.v.kept">erros mantidos</span></span>
          <div class="v-crush__row"><span data-i18n="f4.v.before">antes</span><span class="v-crush__bar"></span><b>637 KB</b></div>
          <div class="v-crush__row v-crush__row--after"><span data-i18n="f4.v.after">depois</span><span class="v-crush__bar"></span><b>31 KB</b></div>
        </div></div>
    </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

