<section class="sec ins grain" id="instalar" aria-labelledby="ins-title">
  <div class="wrap ins__grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow rv"><b>07</b> <span data-i18n="ins.eyebrow">Instalação</span></p>
      <h2 class="h-section rv" id="ins-title" data-i18n="ins.title">Dois comandos. <em>Sem passo três.</em></h2>
      <ol class="steps rv">
        <li><div><h3 data-i18n="ins.st1">Instale o pacote</h3><p data-i18n="ins.st1p">Requer Node.js 20 ou superior. Funciona em Windows, macOS e Linux.</p></div></li>
        <li><div><h3 data-i18n="ins.st2">Rode <code>egc install</code></h3><p data-i18n="ins.st2p">Detecta suas ferramentas, registra os servidores MCP locais e escreve o protocolo de memória. Só pergunta se você quer a biblioteca de prompts opcional.</p></div></li>
        <li><div><h3 data-i18n="ins.st3">Converse normalmente</h3><p data-i18n="ins.st3p">Abra sua ferramenta e diga “vamos continuar”. A memória carrega sozinha.</p></div></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div class="term rv" style="--rd:.1s">
      <div class="term__tabs" role="tablist" data-i18n-attr="aria-label:ins.tabs" aria-label="Sistema de instalação">
        <button class="term__tab" role="tab" id="tab-npm" aria-controls="panel-npm" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" type="button">npm<small data-i18n="ins.rec">recomendado</small></button>
        <button class="term__tab" role="tab" id="tab-linux" aria-controls="panel-linux" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" type="button">Linux</button>
        <button class="term__tab" role="tab" id="tab-macos" aria-controls="panel-macos" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" type="button">macOS</button>
        <button class="term__tab" role="tab" id="tab-windows" aria-controls="panel-windows" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" type="button">Windows</button>
      </div>
      <div class="term__panel" role="tabpanel" id="panel-npm" aria-labelledby="tab-npm" tabindex="0" data-cmd="npm install -g @egchq/egc&#10;egc install">
        <p class="term__note" data-i18n="ins.npmNote">Linux, macOS e Windows. Não precisa clonar o repositório.</p>
<pre><span class="p">$ </span>npm install -g @egchq/egc
<span class="p">$ </span>egc install
<span class="c" data-i18n="ins.verify"># conferir</span>
<span class="p">$ </span>egc doctor
<span class="ok">egc-guardian running</span>
<span class="ok">egc-memory   running</span></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="term__panel" role="tabpanel" id="panel-linux" aria-labelledby="tab-linux" tabindex="0" hidden data-cmd="git clone https://github.com/Fmarzochi/EGC.git&#10;cd EGC &amp;&amp; sh scripts/install.sh">
        <p class="term__note" data-i18n="ins.req">Requer <a href="https://nodejs.org/en/download" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Node.js 20+</a> e git.</p>
<pre><span class="p">$ </span>git clone https://github.com/Fmarzochi/EGC.git
<span class="p">$ </span>cd EGC &amp;&amp; sh scripts/install.sh</pre>
      </div>
      <div class="term__panel" role="tabpanel" id="panel-macos" aria-labelledby="tab-macos" tabindex="0" hidden data-cmd="git clone https://github.com/Fmarzochi/EGC.git&#10;cd EGC &amp;&amp; sh scripts/install.sh">
        <p class="term__note" data-i18n="ins.req">Requer <a href="https://nodejs.org/en/download" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Node.js 20+</a> e git.</p>
<pre><span class="p">$ </span>git clone https://github.com/Fmarzochi/EGC.git
<span class="p">$ </span>cd EGC &amp;&amp; sh scripts/install.sh</pre>
      </div>
      <div class="term__panel" role="tabpanel" id="panel-windows" aria-labelledby="tab-windows" tabindex="0" hidden data-cmd="git clone https://github.com/Fmarzochi/EGC.git&#10;cd EGC; .\scripts\install.ps1">
        <p class="term__note" data-i18n="ins.reqWin">Requer <a href="https://nodejs.org/en/download" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Node.js 20+</a> e PowerShell.</p>
